.venv/

# Secrets / env files
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Never commit credentials embedded in git remote URLs (e.g. http://user:TOKEN@host/...)
# Remote URLs live in .git/config (never committed), but if one was exposed, rotate the token.
# See SECURITY.md -> Known Token Exposure.

